title: The Reichswehr Marches
subtitle: The rising has begun. Where will it be decided?
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: crisis_october = 1 and e23_rising_phase = 1 and crisis_time >= e23_oct_battle_time and e23_battle_done = 0
max-visits: 1
priority: 3
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.e22) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.e22_lib.onArrival); }
RG.e22.octTick(Q.crisis_time);
RG.news('The Reichswehr marches against the rising', 3);
Q.e23_battle_done = 1;
Q.e23_red_ruhr = (Q.ruhr_red_army == 2) ? 1 : 0;
Q.e23_berlin_up = (Q.e23_oct_rising || []).indexOf('berlin') >= 0 ? 1 : 0;
Q.e23_berlin_p = Math.max(0.15, Math.min(0.7, 0.3 + (Q.district_berlin_guards - 2) * 0.08 - (Q.army_loyalty - 50) / 200));
Q.e23_berlin_odds = RG.e22.odds(Q.e23_berlin_p);
Q.e23_berlin_roll = 0;
Q.stability -= 8;
!}

= The Reichswehr Marches

[? if e23_oct_alive >= 1 : The hundreds hold [+ e23_oct_held_names +]. ?][? if e23_oct_alive = 0 : The first week has gone badly, and nothing is held. ?] [? if e23_oct_has_fallen = 1 : The Reichswehr has already retaken [+ e23_oct_fallen_names +]. ?] General von Seeckt has a hundred thousand professional soldiers, the police, the Black Reichswehr and the nationalist leagues. We have the hundreds, [+ e23_oct_arms_words +], and the strike.

[? if e23_red_ruhr = 1 : The councils of the red Ruhr are ready to march, if the French let them. ?][? if bavaria_soviet = 2 : Red Bavaria has called up its workers' guard on the Franconian border. ?][? if warsaw_outcome = 2 : On the Polish border Red Army divisions are moving west. ?]

The Zentrale must choose where to put its reserves.

- @saxony: Make Saxony and Thuringia our fortress.
- @berlin: Everything on Berlin.
- @ruhr: Raise the Ruhr and the ports.
- @spd_gov: Offer the SPD a workers' government for the whole Reich.

@saxony
subtitle: The Reichswehr must come to us in the hills. Safer and slower.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e23_oct_focus = 1;
['saxony', 'thuringia'].forEach(function (d) {
    if (Q.e23_oct_rising.indexOf(d) < 0 && Q['district_' + d + '_repression'] < 70) { Q.e23_oct_rising.push(d); RG.startStrike(d, true); }
    RG.district(d, {guards: 1.5, loyalty: 5});
});
Q.e23_oct_alive = Q.e23_oct_rising.length;
RG.e22.octLines();
Q.lean_unionist += 1;
!}

The hundreds dig in along the Erzgebirge and the Vogtland, and the workers' councils take over the food supply of Chemnitz and Gera.

@berlin
subtitle: If the capital falls, the Reich falls. The military apparatus calls it [+ e23_berlin_odds +].
on-arrival: {!
Q.e23_oct_focus = 2;
Q.e23_berlin_roll = Math.random() < Q.e23_berlin_p ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.e23_oct_rising.indexOf('berlin') < 0) { Q.e23_oct_rising.push('berlin'); RG.startStrike('berlin', true); }
if (Q.e23_berlin_roll) {
    RG.district('berlin', {guards: 3, militancy: 10});
    Q.army_loyalty -= 8;
} else {
    RG.district('berlin', {guards: -Q.district_berlin_guards * 0.5, repression: 10});
}
Q.e23_oct_alive = Q.e23_oct_rising.length;
RG.e22.octLines();
Q.lean_offensive += 2;
!}

[? if e23_berlin_roll = 1 : The hundreds of Wedding and Neukölln cross the Spree at dawn. By noon the Reich Chancellery is under siege, and a battalion in Spandau refuses to leave its barracks. ?][? if e23_berlin_roll = 0 : The attack on the centre runs into machine guns on the Friedrichstrasse. The workers' districts hold. The government quarter does not fall. ?]

@ruhr
subtitle: The pits and the docks come out. Strong where the party is strong.
on-arrival: {!
Q.e23_oct_focus = 3;
['ruhr', 'hamburg', 'bremen'].forEach(function (d) {
    if (Q.e23_oct_rising.indexOf(d) < 0) { Q.e23_oct_rising.push(d); RG.startStrike(d, true); }
});
RG.district('ruhr', {guards: Q.e23_red_ruhr ? 4 : 1.5});
Q.e23_oct_alive = Q.e23_oct_rising.length;
RG.e22.octLines();
Q.lean_ultraleft += 1;
!}

The miners of Bochum and Gelsenkirchen and the dockers of Hamburg and Bremen come out. The French watch from their barracks.

@spd_gov
subtitle: [? if lock_united_front = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] If the SPD's workers come over, the soldiers may not shoot.
choose-if: lock_united_front < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids an offer to the SPD.
on-arrival: {!
RG.e22.against('united_front');
RG.ecci('radek', 4);
Q.e23_oct_bonus += (Q.spd_relation >= 35 ? 5 : 1);
Q.spd_relation += 6;
Q.lean_unionist += 2;
!}

Our offer is printed on every wall: a government of the SPD and the KPD, the officers disarmed, bread for everyone. [? if spd_relation >= 41 : In a dozen cities the SPD branches join the strike, and their executive loses members by the hour. ?][? if spd_relation < 41 : A few SPD branches join the strike. Their executive denounces us. ?]
